msgid "Using OpenTelemetry Logging"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This guide explains how your Quarkus application can utilize https://"
"opentelemetry.io/[OpenTelemetry] (OTel) to provide structured, contextual, "
"vendor-neutral and centralised logging for interactive web applications."
msgstr ""

msgid "This technology is considered {extension-status}."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In _preview_, backward compatibility and presence in the ecosystem is not "
"guaranteed.\n"
"Specific improvements might require changing configuration or APIs, and "
"plans to become _stable_ are under way.\n"
"Feedback is welcome on our https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-"
"dev[mailing list] or as issues in our https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"issues[GitHub issue tracker]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For a full list of possible statuses, check our https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-"
"are-the-extension-statuses[FAQ entry]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This document is part of the xref:observability.adoc[Observability in "
"Quarkus reference guide] which features this and other observability related "
"components."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"OpenTelemetry Logging is considered _tech preview_ and is disabled by "
"default."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The xref:opentelemetry.adoc[OpenTelemetry Guide] is available with signal "
"independent information about the OpenTelemetry extension."
msgstr ""

